{
    "title": "Poster Maker & flyer maker app",
    "description": "Poster maker and flyer maker app offers unique features for graphic designing a variety of promotional posters and advertisement. With over 10,000 editable poster templates, users can create graphic design for social media, marketing poster, YouTube thumbnail banner, and motivational quotes quickly and easily without needing any design skills.\r\n\r\nPoster Maker app:\r\nCreate poster with our vast collection of ready-to-use templates for creating promotional posters, Advertising, offers, and other graphic designs, sale poster for various businesses such as shops, hotels, and restaurants. Make poster for education, school, virtual fundraiser flyer, missing, wanted poster and more. Custom poster design for marketing & Business posters, Vintage, Movie, political, Inspirational posters and more. \r\n\r\nDigital flyer maker:\r\nDesign flyers for business, party, advertisement and sale flyer. Easy to make flyer for any purpose in few minutes.  Businesses use flyer maker apps to create sales flyers to advertise their products, discounts, Promotional flyers. Also they use for brochures, Business pamphlets, leaflets, folders, banners, logo design, Branding design tools and business cards. Creative design software for making digital art design and Print design. All kinds of flyer designs including Real estate flyers, travel flyers, Fitness & gym.\r\n\r\nEvent flyer & Festival Posters:\r\nCreate flyers for events such as Black Friday sales posters, carnivals feasts, festivals like Halloween, Christmas, New Year 2023 posters, Easter, Fourth of July flyer, Labor Day graphic designs. This app is perfect for anyone looking to create professional-looking promotional materials with ease.\r\n\r\nBanner Maker:\r\nDesign custom banners for your business, event, or promotion with our easy-to-use banner maker. Our banner templates are perfect for creating eye-catching banners. Choose from a variety of sizes and designs, including Facebook banners, Twitter, twitch banners, YouTube banners, and more. \r\n\r\nParty Flyer & Music Poster:\r\nCreate stunning party flyers and music posters with our flyer maker app. Add your own text, images, and graphics to create the perfect design for your event. Our flyer maker is perfect for creating flyers for music concerts, parties, club, DJ nights, make party flyers and more. You can also design posters for upcoming album releases, music festivals and other musical events. \r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures of Splendid poster maker:\r\n\r\n1. Create Poster designs, Digital flyer creator, Ads Designs, invitation, etc\r\n2. Modern poster editable and customizable flyer templates.\r\n3. Background remover: Users can remove the background from their photos automatically using the app's background remover tool and make an object or person photo with transparent background.\r\n4. Text editor, fonts, text effects: Many fonts, text art and text effects, add your own fonts to the app to create a personalized design.\r\n5. Add your images or search for online stickers.\r\n6. Photo editor: Users can edit their photos with brightness and contrast adjustments, blur, and overlay effects to make their designs look professional.\r\n7. Video ad maker - Set animation to image and text. Video ad editor and photo to video animation maker.\r\n8. Easy to use.\r\n9. Auto-save\r\n10. Download graphic design as png, jpeg.\r\n11. Save and share flyer design: Users can save their designs as PNG, JPEG, and PDF files and share them on social media platforms like Facebook, WhatsApp, Instagram, and Twitter.\r\n12. High-quality printing\r\n\r\nAnimated poster maker:\r\nVideo flyer and poster maker has animations, gif stickers and all image editing elements to make a video from poster.\r\nMake marketing video for advertisement from poster design, business ad video, promotional video with music, Instagram story ad video post.\r\n\r\nSplendid poster maker app helps you quickly create graphic design for all purpose & promotions. If you need any graphic design templates or queries contact us via email",
    "descriptionHTML": "Poster maker and flyer maker app offers unique features for graphic designing a variety of promotional posters and advertisement. With over 10,000 editable poster templates, users can create graphic design for social media, marketing poster, YouTube thumbnail banner, and motivational quotes quickly and easily without needing any design skills.<br><br>Poster Maker app:<br>Create poster with our vast collection of ready-to-use templates for creating promotional posters, Advertising, offers, and other graphic designs, sale poster for various businesses such as shops, hotels, and restaurants. Make poster for education, school, virtual fundraiser flyer, missing, wanted poster and more. Custom poster design for marketing &amp; Business posters, Vintage, Movie, political, Inspirational posters and more. <br><br>Digital flyer maker:<br>Design flyers for business, party, advertisement and sale flyer. Easy to make flyer for any purpose in few minutes.  Businesses use flyer maker apps to create sales flyers to advertise their products, discounts, Promotional flyers. Also they use for brochures, Business pamphlets, leaflets, folders, banners, logo design, Branding design tools and business cards. Creative design software for making digital art design and Print design. All kinds of flyer designs including Real estate flyers, travel flyers, Fitness &amp; gym.<br><br>Event flyer &amp; Festival Posters:<br>Create flyers for events such as Black Friday sales posters, carnivals feasts, festivals like Halloween, Christmas, New Year 2023 posters, Easter, Fourth of July flyer, Labor Day graphic designs. This app is perfect for anyone looking to create professional-looking promotional materials with ease.<br><br>Banner Maker:<br>Design custom banners for your business, event, or promotion with our easy-to-use banner maker. Our banner templates are perfect for creating eye-catching banners. Choose from a variety of sizes and designs, including Facebook banners, Twitter, twitch banners, YouTube banners, and more. <br><br>Party Flyer &amp; Music Poster:<br>Create stunning party flyers and music posters with our flyer maker app. Add your own text, images, and graphics to create the perfect design for your event. Our flyer maker is perfect for creating flyers for music concerts, parties, club, DJ nights, make party flyers and more. You can also design posters for upcoming album releases, music festivals and other musical events. <br><br><br>Features of Splendid poster maker:<br><br>1. Create Poster designs, Digital flyer creator, Ads Designs, invitation, etc<br>2. Modern poster editable and customizable flyer templates.<br>3. Background remover: Users can remove the background from their photos automatically using the app&#39;s background remover tool and make an object or person photo with transparent background.<br>4. Text editor, fonts, text effects: Many fonts, text art and text effects, add your own fonts to the app to create a personalized design.<br>5. Add your images or search for online stickers.<br>6. Photo editor: Users can edit their photos with brightness and contrast adjustments, blur, and overlay effects to make their designs look professional.<br>7. Video ad maker - Set animation to image and text. Video ad editor and photo to video animation maker.<br>8. Easy to use.<br>9. Auto-save<br>10. Download graphic design as png, jpeg.<br>11. Save and share flyer design: Users can save their designs as PNG, JPEG, and PDF files and share them on social media platforms like Facebook, WhatsApp, Instagram, and Twitter.<br>12. High-quality printing<br><br>Animated poster maker:<br>Video flyer and poster maker has animations, gif stickers and all image editing elements to make a video from poster.<br>Make marketing video for advertisement from poster design, business ad video, promotional video with music, Instagram story ad video post.<br><br>Splendid poster maker app helps you quickly create graphic design for all purpose &amp; promotions. If you need any graphic design templates or queries contact us via email",
